        <div>
          <head n="1" source="#source-451614-451704"><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-451704-451788"><lem><seg source="#source-451614-451644">欧洲婦人の髪（晶子）</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-451764-451782">欧洲婦人の髪</seg></rdg></app></head>
