          <p source="#source-582697-583179"><seg source="#source-582697-582745">前衛：300メエトル　附け剣　前へ　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-582745-582769"><rb>大道</rb><rt>だいだう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-582769-582799">　散兵　熱心　激励　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-582799-582820"><rb>群馬</rb><rt>ぐんば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-582820-582823">　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-582823-582838"><rb>腋</rb><rt>わき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-582838-582841">　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-582841-582859"><rb>項</rb><rt>うなじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-582859-582871">　褐色　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-582871-582898"><rb>銅色</rb><rt>どうしよく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-582898-582901">　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-582901-582919"><rb>気息</rb><rt>いき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-582919-582931">づかひ　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-582931-582949"><rb>＋</rb><rt>プラス</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-582949-582952">　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-582952-582976"><rb>背嚢</rb><rt>はいなう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-582976-583006">　３０キロ　警戒＝大</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-583006-583045"><rb>秤量機</rb><rt>ひやうりやうき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-583045-583063">　鉄屑　貯金</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-583063-583081"><rb>筒</rb><rt>づつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-583081-583084">　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-583084-583105"><rb>怯儒</rb><rt>きよだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-583105-583179">：３戦慄　号令　石　熱狂　敵　誘導物　敏捷　名誉</seg></p>
