          <head n="1" source="#source-610339-610456"><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-610456-610552"><lem><seg source="#source-610339-610354">平野丸より</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-610354-610375"><rb>良人</rb><rt>をつと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-610375-610390">に（晶子）</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-610522-610546">平野丸より良人に</seg></rdg></app></head>
